% L3: an outstanding request can always still be completed.
% Revised 2026-10-21 (validLoc bound added), original in docs/design.md section 5.
forall o, d: Loc . val(validLoc(o) && validLoc(d)) =>
  % after request(o, d), as long as no done(o, d) has happened ...
  [true* . request(o, d) . (!done(o, d))*]
    % ... a path to done(o, d) still exists
    <true* . done(o, d)> true
